^{:go/end 535} (go/method traverseAuxSyms "Traverse aux symbols, calling fn for each sym/aux pair.\n" [^{:tag (* Link)} ctxt ^traverseFlag flag ^{:tag (func [^{:tag (* LSym)} parent ^{:tag (* LSym)} aux])} fn]
